### Create a simple tag
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/tags
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "NestJS",
  "slug": "https://example.com/tags/nestjs",
  "description": "Node.js framework for building scalable server-side applications"
}

### Create a tag with feature image
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/tags
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "TypeScript",
  "slug": "https://example.com/tags/typescript",
  "description": "Typed superset of JavaScript that compiles to plain JavaScript",
  "featureImageUrl": "https://example.com/images/typescript.png"
}

### Create a tag with schema metadata
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/tags
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "REST API",
  "slug": "https://example.com/tags/rest-api",
  "description": "Representational State Transfer architecture for web APIs",
  "schema": "{\"category\": \"architecture\", \"level\": \"intermediate\"}"
}

### Create a comprehensive tag with all fields
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/tags
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Database Design",
  "slug": "https://example.com/tags/database-design",
  "description": "Principles and practices for designing efficient databases",
  "featureImageUrl": "https://example.com/images/database.png",
  "schema": "{\"category\": \"backend\", \"difficulty\": \"advanced\", \"tools\": [\"PostgreSQL\", \"MongoDB\"]}"
}

### Create a minimal tag
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/tags
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Testing",
  "slug": "https://example.com/tags/testing"
}


POST http://localhost:8000/v1/tags
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Testing Deletion",
  "slug": "https://example.com/tags/testing-deletion"
}
